mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Fail[Element can fail] --> Q1{Did you add a fault path?}
  Q1 -->|No| Unhandled[Unhandled fault: generic error; save may fail]
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Screen Flow with a user present?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Screen[Screen showing Fault Message; optional retry connector]
  Q2 -->|Record-triggered| Email[Send Email or Create log record with Fault Message]
  Screen --> Q3{Partial DML in this transaction must not remain?}
  Email --> Q3
  Q3 -->|Yes still pending| Roll[Roll Back Records on the fault path]
  Q3 -->|Already committed after pause| TooLate[Cannot roll back prior transaction; compensate or reverse with new DML]
